# Go launcher binary
tools/launcher/rigel-launcher

# Harness media.
#
# Deny by default: Kickstart ROMs and commercial disks are not redistributable,
# and an accidental commit of one is not something a later commit undoes. Only
# images that are explicitly free to redistribute are re-included below.
#
# Git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so the
# directories are kept and the files inside them are what gets excluded.
media/**
!media/roms/
!media/disks/
!media/README.md

# AROS — APL, freely redistributable.
# Anchored to a leading "aros"/"new_aros" on purpose: a loose *aros* glob also
# matches names like WB13_aros.adf, which is a Workbench disk and is not free.
!media/roms/aros*.rom
!media/roms/new_aros*.rom
!media/disks/aros*.adf
!media/disks/bootdisk-amiga-m68k.adf

# DiagROM (John Hertell) — freely redistributable
!media/roms/diagrom*.rom
!media/roms/DiagROM*.rom

# Amiga Test Kit (Keir Fraser) — open source
!media/disks/AmigaTestKit.adf

# lide.device (LIV2) — open source
!media/roms/lide.rom

# Generated by the test scripts
tools/tests/musashi_fpu/fputest.S
tools/tests/musashi_fpu/expected.json
tools/tests/chipset/*.bin
